@TunnelWatch.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5161

### Popis uređaja i vrijeme njihove zadnje poruke
GET {{TunnelWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/gateways
Accept: application/json

### Zadnje vrijednosti svih signala uređaja tdce-01
GET {{TunnelWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/gateways/tdce-01/latest
Accept: application/json

### Uređaj bez podataka: očekuje se 404 "Nema podataka za uređaj"
GET {{TunnelWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/gateways/nepostojeci/latest
Accept: application/json

### Popis pravila alarma
GET {{TunnelWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/rules
Accept: application/json

### Novo pravilo: temperatura rashladne tekućine > 95 °C dulje od 10 s, kritično
POST {{TunnelWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/rules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gatewayId": "tdce-01",
  "signalName": "engine_coolant_temperature",
  "operator": ">",
  "threshold": 95,
  "durationSeconds": 10,
  "hysteresis": 3,
  "severity": "Critical",
  "repeatSuppressionSeconds": 300,
  "enabled": true
}

### Isključivanje pravila 1 (PUT šalje cijelo pravilo)
PUT {{TunnelWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/rules/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gatewayId": "tdce-01",
  "signalName": "engine_coolant_temperature",
  "operator": ">",
  "threshold": 95,
  "durationSeconds": 10,
  "hysteresis": 3,
  "severity": "Critical",
  "repeatSuppressionSeconds": 300,
  "enabled": false
}

### Neispravno pravilo: nepoznat operator i negativno trajanje, očekuje se 400
POST {{TunnelWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/rules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gatewayId": "tdce-01",
  "signalName": "engine_coolant_temperature",
  "operator": "==",
  "threshold": 95,
  "durationSeconds": -10,
  "hysteresis": 3,
  "severity": "Critical",
  "repeatSuppressionSeconds": 300
}

### Brisanje pravila 1
DELETE {{TunnelWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/rules/1
